# GRAFANA, on the site's host and port 3443 -- the console's arrangement, for the same reason: the
# session cookie is host-only and ignores the port, so the site's sign-in reaches it. Only on a
# machine whose env file sets TB_MONITORING=1 (compose/monitoring.yml publishes the port):
#
#   cp grafana.caddy.example grafana.caddy
#
# The gate behind it decides who gets in; this only terminates TLS.
{$SITE_HOST}:3443 {
	import access_log
	import headers
	reverse_proxy grafana-gate:8080
}
